Description: lh-kernel - KSPP Benchmark Alignment & Sysctl Hardening Coefficient
 Linux kernel security posture auditor evaluating runtime sysctl parameters, Kconfig flags, ASLR, eBPF restrictions, ptrace scopes, and kernel module blacklists against KSPP and CIS benchmarks.
